sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Windows Receiver
    participant W as Cloudflare Worker
    participant D as Session Durable Object
    participant B as Browser Sender

    R->>W: POST /v1/sessions
    W->>W: Generate session/receiver/join tokens
    opt TURN enabled
        W->>W: Generate short-lived TURN credentials
    end
    W->>D: Initialize session + fixed expiresAt
    D->>D: setAlarm(expiresAt)
    D-->>W: Created
    W-->>R: 201 sessionId, receiverToken, joinUrl, RTC config

    R->>R: Render joinUrl as QR
    B->>B: Scan QR, open /send/#...
    B->>B: Parse fragment and remove from address bar
    B->>B: User presses Start
    B->>B: getUserMedia(camera, microphone)

    B->>W: POST /sessions/{id}/claim + Join Token
    W->>D: Claim(session, nonce)
    D-->>W: Sender Token + RTC config
    W-->>B: 200 Sender Token

    par Receiver waits for Offer
        loop 1s then 2s polling
            R->>W: GET /sessions/{id}/offer + Receiver Token
            W->>D: Read Offer
            alt Offer not ready
                D-->>W: no content
                W-->>R: 204 Retry-After
            else Offer ready
                D-->>W: Offer
                W-->>R: 200 Offer
            end
        end
    and Browser creates Offer
        B->>B: RTCPeerConnection + sendonly tracks
        B->>B: createOffer / setLocalDescription
        B->>B: Wait ICE gathering complete
        B->>W: PUT /sessions/{id}/offer + Sender Token
        W->>D: Store Offer
        D-->>W: OFFER_READY
        W-->>B: 204
    end

    R->>R: setRemoteDescription(Offer)
    R->>R: createAnswer / setLocalDescription
    R->>R: Wait ICE gathering complete
    R->>W: PUT /sessions/{id}/answer + Receiver Token
    W->>D: Store Answer
    D-->>W: ANSWER_READY
    W-->>R: 204

    loop 1s then 2s polling
        B->>W: GET /sessions/{id}/answer + Sender Token
        W->>D: Read Answer
        alt Answer not ready
            D-->>W: no content
            W-->>B: 204 Retry-After
        else Answer ready
            D-->>W: Answer
            W-->>B: 200 Answer
        end
    end

    B->>B: setRemoteDescription(Answer)
    B-->>R: ICE + DTLS-SRTP + RTP/RTCP media
    R->>R: Preview video
    R->>R: Playout audio to VB-CABLE
    R->>R: Publish NV12 frames to Virtual Camera pipe

    opt Connected cleanup
        R->>W: DELETE /sessions/{id}
        W->>D: Close and delete state
        W-->>R: 204
    end
